<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Kichijoji"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lilas"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Sketch"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPP302300071"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1671948843"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Lilas</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">不知时隔多久 随橙色电车摇晃</text><text for="L2">眼前渐渐浮现</text><text for="L3">那缕熟悉的气息 撩动着记忆深处</text><text for="L4">曾经寒来暑往 无论哪一天</text><text for="L5">总是一路颠簸后踏上的</text><text for="L6">清晨站台</text><text for="L7">至今仍清晰记得那发车铃声</text><text for="L8">日复一日从未改变的轨迹</text><text for="L9">穿过街道 走下台阶</text><text for="L10">便望见了七井桥</text><text for="L11">环顾左右 望向四周</text><text for="L12">如今身旁尽是素未谋面的陌生脸庞</text><text for="L13">只能悄悄找寻昔日熟悉的身影</text><text for="L14">好想见你啊</text><text for="L15">会不会碰巧遇见呢</text><text for="L16">形单影只走在这座小城 真的好寂寞</text><text for="L17">俯拾皆是散落各处的往日碎片</text><text for="L18">一件件悉心拾起</text><text for="L19">在眼前的风景里一一重新映现</text><text for="L20">临近毕业的那个午后</text><text for="L21">划着手摇小船</text><text for="L22">水波微微晃荡</text><text for="L23">从树下仰望着那株垂枝樱</text><text for="L24">身旁聊着恋爱心事 欢声笑语不断</text><text for="L25">一片飘落的花瓣</text><text for="L26">依依不舍地目送它远去</text><text for="L27">走过木桥 穿过喷泉</text><text for="L28">排排长椅承载着满满记忆</text><text for="L29">那时抱着一把吉他唱过的歌</text><text for="L30">你还记得吗</text><text for="L31">你曾作为听众 静静听我唱歌</text><text for="L32">好想见你</text><text for="L33">在某个转角会不会重逢呢</text><text for="L34">哪怕是那些平凡却又特别的青葱岁月</text><text for="L35">随着岁月悄然流逝</text><text for="L36">纵然不愿遗忘 却终究慢慢淡去</text><text for="L37">所以带上彼此的珍藏记忆 再聚在一起畅谈吧</text><text for="L38">为了不让那些美好褪去色彩</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:26.429"><div begin="0:11.327" end="2:26.429"><p begin="0:11.327" end="0:14.057" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.327" end="0:11.617">いつ</span><span begin="0:11.617" end="0:11.757">振</span><span begin="0:11.757" end="0:11.967">り</span><span begin="0:11.967" end="0:12.277">か</span><span begin="0:12.277" end="0:12.387">の</span><span begin="0:12.387" end="0:12.467">Or</span><span begin="0:12.467" end="0:12.917">ange</span> <span begin="0:12.917" end="0:13.217">Line</span><span begin="0:13.217" end="0:13.377">揺</span><span begin="0:13.377" end="0:13.647">ら</span><span begin="0:13.647" end="0:14.057">れ</span></p><p begin="0:14.967" end="0:16.227" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.967" end="0:15.117">見</span><span begin="0:15.117" end="0:15.247">え</span><span begin="0:15.247" end="0:15.507">て</span><span begin="0:15.507" end="0:15.997">く</span><span begin="0:15.997" end="0:16.227">る</span></p><p begin="0:16.227" end="0:21.467" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.227" end="0:16.877">懐</span><span begin="0:16.877" end="0:17.017">か</span><span begin="0:17.017" end="0:17.367">しい</span><span begin="0:17.367" end="0:18.107">香</span><span begin="0:18.107" end="0:18.287">り</span><span begin="0:18.287" end="0:18.437">が</span><span begin="0:18.607" end="0:18.797">記</span><span begin="0:18.797" end="0:19.047">憶</span><span begin="0:19.047" end="0:19.317">の</span><span begin="0:19.317" end="0:19.967">奥</span><span begin="0:19.967" end="0:20.227">を</span><span begin="0:20.227" end="0:20.367">く</span><span begin="0:20.367" end="0:20.637">す</span><span begin="0:20.637" end="0:20.877">ぐっ</span><span begin="0:20.877" end="0:21.307">て</span><span begin="0:21.307" end="0:21.467">る</span></p><p begin="0:21.597" end="0:22.907" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.597" end="0:21.747">来</span><span begin="0:21.747" end="0:21